Filetype: IR signals file
Version: 1
#
# Remko SKM 260 Eco - mobile room air conditioner (2.6 kW, R290)
# REMKO GmbH & Co. KG, Im Seelenkamp 12-18, 32791 Lage, Germany
# https://www.remko.de/
# Original IR remote: REMKO art. 1123214 (fits SKM 250 / 260 / 330 Eco)
#
# Protocol: NEC, address 0x20. One discrete command per button.
# This unit does NOT use state frames - every button is a toggle or a
# step, so Cool_hi / Cool_lo / Heat_hi / Heat_lo cannot be expressed as
# single codes. The unit is cool/dry/fan only and has no heating mode.
# "Off" is the power toggle (also switches the unit on).
#
# Found by matching the Flipper universal AC list (the hit is filed there
# under "Maytag M6X06F2A"), then sweeping NEC address 0x20, commands
# 0x00-0xFF, against a real SKM 260 Eco. Verified working.
#
name: Off
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 20 00 00 00
command: 02 00 00 00
#
# cycles cool / dry / fan
name: Mode
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 20 00 00 00
command: 09 00 00 00
#
# temperature up, or timer up when timer is active
name: Temp_up
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 20 00 00 00
command: 0A 00 00 00
#
# temperature down, or timer down when timer is active
name: Temp_dn
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 20 00 00 00
command: 11 00 00 00
#
# timer on/off
name: Timer
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 20 00 00 00
command: 19 00 00 00
#
# cycles fan speed high / medium / low
name: Fan
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 20 00 00 00
command: 1A 00 00 00
#
